{"version":1,"content":"<p>頭髮乾燥、毛躁、缺乏光澤，是不少人的日常困擾。</p><p>而在秋冬，寒風及乾燥天氣更令髮絲水分加快流失。</p><p>護膚界早已奉為聖品的乳木果油（Shea Butter），其實對頭髮同樣功效顯著——保濕、修復、增亮，三管齊下，今個冬天不妨將其納入護髮日常。</p><p>&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T02:18:55.625674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:00:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:15.409285+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T02:12:15.409285+00:00","content_hash":"b3d14771a5fb3d8fdebd1df29ea77ac35e56611efe9971fe11b1d22bdf2ef32f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}